# Count how often the push button on Port 1 line 8 is pressed (the contact clip).
# Start: 000 PC RUN
# Contact clips on Port 1 line(s) 8: hold Shift + the line number to press one.
# An open line reads 1, a pressed one 0. The program waits for the press, counts, then waits for the release.

000 ako 04.000
001 abs 06.020
002 lda 05.020
003 anz 02.000
004 p1e 16.008
005 vgl 10.021
006 spb 11.004
007 lda 05.020
008 add 07.021
009 abs 06.020
010 anz 02.000
011 p1e 16.008
012 vgl 10.022
013 spb 11.011
014 spu 09.004
021     00.001
022     00.000
